{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: Agent基础概念MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent 设计中的最佳实践有哪些？如何避免常见陷阱？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent基础概念\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> advanced\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> medium\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/基础概念\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/advanced</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">在设计和实现 Agent 系统时，有哪些最佳实践？常见的陷阱有哪些？请结合实际工程经验给出建议。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"1. 答案\" dir=\"auto\">1. 答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Agent 设计的十大最佳实践：</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>1. 从小处着手（Start Small）</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 不要一上来就构建复杂系统</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># Phase 1: 先做一个能用的单工具 Agent</span>\nphase1_agent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ReActAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tools<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>search_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># Phase 2: 添加记忆</span>\nphase2_agent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ReActAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tools<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>search_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> memory<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>ShortTermMemory<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># Phase 3: 增加规划能力</span>\nphase3_agent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> PlanAndExecuteAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tools<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>search_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> calc_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                                   memory<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>TieredMemory<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># Phase 4: 生产级（状态机 + 监控 + 安全）</span>\nphase4_agent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ProductionAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    state_machine<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> monitoring<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> security_policy<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>strict\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>2. 工具描述要精确简洁</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 不好的工具描述</span>\nbad_description <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"搜索工具，可以搜索各种东西\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 好的工具描述</span>\ngood_description <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\nsearch_web: 使用 Google 搜索网页信息\n参数:\n  - query (string, required): 搜索关键词，建议 3-10 个词\n返回:\n  - 搜索结果列表，每条包含标题、摘要、URL\n注意事项:\n  - 适用于查找事实性信息\n  - 不适用于数学计算（请使用 calculator 工具）\n\"\"\"</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>3. 提供 Few-shot 示例</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">FEW_SHOT_PROMPT <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n以下是工具调用的示例：\n\n示例 1:\n用户：北京今天天气怎么样？\n思考：用户想知道北京今天的天气，我应该调用天气查询工具。\n行动：search_weather(city=\"北京\", date=\"today\")\n观察：北京今天晴，25°C，微风\n回答：北京今天天气晴朗，气温 25°C，微风，适合出行。\n\n示例 2:\n用户：23 乘以 47 等于多少？\n思考：这是一个数学计算，我应该使用计算器工具。\n行动：calculator(expression=\"23 * 47\")\n观察：1081\n回答：23 乘以 47 等于 1081。\n\n现在请处理以下请求：\n{user_input}\n\"\"\"</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>4. 实现完善的错误处理</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">RobustToolExecutor</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"健壮的工具执行器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">execute_with_retry</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> params<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_retries<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"带重试的工具执行\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> attempt <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">range</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>max_retries<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>run<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">**</span>params<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> ToolResult<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>success<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> RateLimitError<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token comment\"># 指数退避</span>\n                wait <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span> <span class=\"token operator\">**</span> attempt\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> asyncio<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>sleep<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>wait<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> ToolNotFoundError<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token comment\"># 不可恢复错误</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> ToolResult<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>error<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"工具不存在: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> Exception <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> attempt <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> max_retries <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> ToolResult<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>error<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> ToolResult<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>error<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"达到最大重试次数\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>5. 设置安全边界（Guardrails）</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">SafetyGuardrails</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"安全边界\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    DANGEROUS_PATTERNS <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">r\"rm\\s+-rf\\s+/\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>           <span class=\"token comment\"># 删除文件系统</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">r\"DROP\\s+TABLE\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>           <span class=\"token comment\"># 删除数据库</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">r\"&lt;script&gt;.*&lt;/script&gt;\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>    <span class=\"token comment\"># XSS 攻击</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    SENSITIVE_TOOLS <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"send_money\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"delete_data\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"grant_access\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">check_input</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> user_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> SafetyCheck<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"检查用户输入\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> pattern <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>DANGEROUS_PATTERNS<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> re<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>search<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>pattern<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> user_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> re<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>IGNORECASE<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> SafetyCheck<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>blocked<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"检测到危险模式: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>pattern<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> SafetyCheck<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>safe<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">check_tool_call</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> params<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                        user<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> User<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> SafetyCheck<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"检查工具调用\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> tool_name <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>SENSITIVE_TOOLS<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> user<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>has_permission<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"tool.</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> SafetyCheck<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>blocked<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"权限不足\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 敏感操作需要二次确认</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> SafetyCheck<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>requires_confirmation<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"确认执行 </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">(</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>params<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">)?\"</span></span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> SafetyCheck<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>safe<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>6. 保持可观测性</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ObservableAgent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"可观测的 Agent\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">run</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> user_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        trace_id <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> generate_trace_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">with</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tracer<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>start_span<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"agent_run\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> trace_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> span<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            span<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>set_attribute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"user_input\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> user_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token comment\"># 记录每个步骤</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> step <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>execute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>user_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                    self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>logger<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>info<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"Step </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>step<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>number<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                                   extra<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"trace_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> trace_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                                          <span class=\"token string\">\"thought\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> step<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                                          <span class=\"token string\">\"action\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> step<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                                          <span class=\"token string\">\"observation\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> step<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>observation<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                    \n                    <span class=\"token comment\"># 发送指标</span>\n                    self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>metrics<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>record_step<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>step<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                \n            <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> Exception <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>logger<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>error<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"Agent error: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                                extra<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"trace_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> trace_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>metrics<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>record_error<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">raise</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> result\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>7. 设计 Human-in-the-loop</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">HumanInTheLoop</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"人机协作机制\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.7</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">should_ask_human</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> decision<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Decision<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"判断是否需要人工确认\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 低置信度</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> decision<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>confidence <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 高成本操作</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> decision<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>estimated_cost <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">100</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 敏感操作</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> decision<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>involves_sensitive_data<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 不可逆操作</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> decision<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>is_irreversible<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>常见陷阱与避坑指南：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>过度设计</strong></td>\n<td>一上来就搞多 Agent、复杂编排</td>\n<td>从单 Agent 开始，逐步迭代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>工具过多</strong></td>\n<td>一次暴露太多工具给 LLM</td>\n<td>每次最多 8 个工具，动态加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>忽视安全</strong></td>\n<td>没有输入校验和权限控制</td>\n<td>沙箱执行、权限检查、审计日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>忽略成本</strong></td>\n<td>不注意 Token 消耗</td>\n<td>设置预算上限、监控每任务成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>缺乏监控</strong></td>\n<td>上线后不知道运行状况</td>\n<td>完善的日志、指标、告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Prompt 脆弱</strong></td>\n<td>Prompt 对模型版本敏感</td>\n<td>多模型测试、Prompt 版本管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>无降级方案</strong></td>\n<td>工具失败就整体失败</td>\n<td>设计 fallback 策略、优雅降级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>忽视用户体验</strong></td>\n<td>响应慢、不可解释</td>\n<td>流式输出、显示思考过程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 data-heading=\"2. 延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">2. 延伸追问</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：Agent 系统的最大技术难点是什么？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：<strong>可控性 vs 自主性</strong>的平衡。太可控则不够智能，太自主则不安全。解决方案：分层的权限设计、渐进式授权、关键操作人工确认。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：如何保证 Agent 系统在不同 LLM 模型间的迁移性？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：①抽象 LLM 接口 ②Prompt 模板化管理 ③针对不同模型做适配层 ④统一的功能测试覆盖</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-heading=\"3. 常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">3. 常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：Agent 可以完全替代人工</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：当前 Agent 适合处理明确边界内的任务，复杂决策、创意工作和情感交互仍需人类参与。Agent 是\"辅助\"而非\"替代\"</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<blockquote dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>文档结束</strong></p>\n<p>本文档共覆盖 17 道高质量面试题，涵盖 Agent 基础定义、四大核心组件、工作循环、ReAct 框架、Agent 分类、记忆系统设计、工具调用、规划方法、反思机制、生产级状态机、评估体系和最佳实践。</p>\n<p>建议读者结合 LangChain、LangGraph 等框架动手实践，加深理解。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 data-heading=\"4. 相关\" dir=\"auto\">4. 相关</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a> — 返回主题导航</li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}